  "description": "Fresh out of college, Jiha Lim is basking in riches as a successful BL doujinshi artist of the megahit webtoon \"Hot-Blooded Academy\" by Art Kang. One day, Jiha snatches up a once-in-a-blue-moon opportunity to work for Art as his prized assistant. Little did he know he would fall for Art's blinding good looks at first sight. And thus begins Jiha's diabolically intricate plans to win him over... and also get him to play for the other team!\n\n(Source: NETCOMICS)",
